Kq4SFPlEO2QWwh1yovIVsZBtlLxvvKjws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwmAvu6ihvLNvQdLjiMh_KkwC25Bw6O1FqYhlZFQsonJQ&oe=69AEACE6"}, {"file_name": "Tend-with-Friends-Screenshots-3.png", "id": "1038102558466176", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_1038102561799509_2145509638781487840_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RUQIyt6aHEUQ7kNvwFmYV8C&_nc_oc=AdmMF9h_XSJspHpZD_3ZYtQozGoBZav-qvPxydbccTBTwdKhBc-W65eHuclUTbJwqDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxJukIfHoJUjx1_fK1zUZwv8yP0OHh1FlOB9CI-n04QCQ&oe=69AEAFDD"}, {"file_name": "2026-01 - First Bloom - Screenshot 3.png", "id": "1564701294559251", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_1564701297892584_1032540183332829449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q7qbo0Nq-_EQ7kNvwH6w7qu&_nc_oc=Adng3P1jGp0t0FoQlBuvFmigrNT3RmQ0xoo24FXWEBFHp_Cibo5Gw3QctMe0gG_dj8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwAPu9Kcj3flp3N6xng22FWqP5f5_D07L7fiWjZjumLww&oe=69AEBA7A"}, {"file_name": "2026-01 - First Bloom - Screenshot 1.png", "id": "1179206614192114", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_1179206617525447_6426718312682771437_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GlNaSrvmJrUQ7kNvwHFLXrc&_nc_oc=Adlm94K9D81K6BTli1VSTWyBaA9SQfR_L7ofyzfc9B_scD3yEo697zNeQgRYDMY-wDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxM5MbFNCFZ_F34JPb--Cwg3jKGtdiRkvzwZFHEnao_sg&oe=69AEC7BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Cover Image B.png", "id": "1427551878968556", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307433_1427551882301889_3826374479952921275_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KaKLw_G1UP8Q7kNvwEYSALy&_nc_oc=Adl1B2eUDksUnzZasyt3dIaZKZCwYfQ90cDRRhnJ_KY4iGLT8mU0_DEkC2MBquxBn-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzADOF-KLB92gl6dYlK2FZqGtNkjo9K2ke10EgLZRtjGg&oe=69AEB290"}, "display_name": "Tend with Friends - Garden Sim", "keywords": ["garden", "cozy", "plants", "relaxing", "gardening"], "long_description": "**Tend with Friends** is your new, magical gardening experience. Grow a collection of curious, moody, and beautiful plants that need more than just water, they need you!\n\n# \ud83c\udf31 Watch Life Unfold\nWitness every leaf unfurl & flower bloom in real-time. Inspired by reality, our artists hand-crafted every frame of growth to make your plants feel truly alive.\n{1818206152197505}\n\n#  \ud83e\udde9  Blooms Take Time, Patience is the Best Fertilizer\nOur core belief is that every plant experience should spark joy. No plants die in **Tend with Friends**, they just might be moodier, shy, or extra demanding!\n{831540516427888}\n\n\n# \ud83d\udc4b Your World, Your Hands\nNo controllers needed. Using just your hands, place virtual pots right on your real coffee table or bookshelf.\n{860635716550743}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfb6 Find Your Vibe\nCustomize your sanctuary with hand-painted backgrounds and a \"soundbath\" soundtrack to set the right mood.\n{1374563571035503}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf3cStart Your Garden for Free\nDip your toes in the soil for free, featuring 5 unique plants and a collection of cozy decor.\n{2058767028232934}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf3a Ready to grow more?\nThe **Founder's Collection** is available for those who want the full botanical experience: unlocking 10+ rare plants, new backgrounds, music, and exclusive designer pots.\n\n# Transform your world, one plant at a time.\n\ud83e\udeb4", "short_description": "Tend with Friends is your new, magical gardening experience. Grow a collection of curious, moody, and beautiful plants that need more than just water, they need you!"}]}, "developer_name": "Theory Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://tendwithfriends.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Theory Studios", "support_website_url": "http://tendwit